                                "en": "For the royal ceremony, she put on her finest <w>festive attire</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Morgause zat daar al in haar mooiste kleed en ze had Morgaine een saffraankleurig <w>feestgewaad</w> aangetrokken.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "Morgause was already sitting there in her finest dress, and she had dressed Morgaine in a saffron-colored <w>festive garb</w>."
                            }
                        }
                    ],
